      <h2>Client stories</h2>
      <p class="cs-lede">Moves Chayce coordinated, from packing and removals to a full relocation including finding the new home.</p>

      <div class="cs-card">
        <h3>Finding a smaller home and relocating, with the children living abroad</h3>
        <span class="cs-meta">Client story &middot; Platinum Bespoke</span>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>Situation</b><span>Henry and Sofia were getting older and living in a large house that had become more than they needed. Their children had moved to another country, so there was no family nearby to help with a move.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>What they needed</b><span>Help with the whole move, starting with finding a smaller, more manageable home.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>How Chayce helped</b><span>They contacted Chayce, which helped them find a smaller home and then coordinated the full relocation under the Platinum Bespoke package.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>Outcome</b><span>After the move, the couple were happy in their new home and wanted to stay.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>Service</b><span><a href="/platinum-bespoke/">Platinum Bespoke</a></span></div>
        <p class="cs-privacy">Client identity withheld at their request.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-card">
        <h3>Packing, removals and cleaning once the sale was done</h3>
        <span class="cs-meta">Client story &middot; Bronze Essentials</span>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>Situation</b><span>Margaret had already sold her home and secured her new property, but the thought of packing, coordinating removals and leaving the house clean was becoming overwhelming.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>What she needed</b><span>She did not need someone to manage the sale or find her a property. She wanted the physical move handled properly.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>How Chayce helped</b><span>Chayce organised the packing, removals and cleaning, taking the physical workload away and leaving her free to focus on the move itself.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>Outcome</b><span>Margaret could move into her new home without spending weeks dealing with boxes, lifting furniture or coordinating several different providers.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>Service</b><span><a href="/bronze-essentials/">Bronze Essentials</a></span></div>
        <p class="cs-privacy">Client identity withheld at their request.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-card">
        <h3>Downsizing from a home of more than 30 years</h3>
        <span class="cs-meta">Client story &middot; Silver Comfort</span>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>Situation</b><span>David and Anne were downsizing from the family home they had lived in for more than 30 years. They had already decided where they were moving, but the number of things that needed organising quickly became too much.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>What they needed</b><span>Someone to take responsibility for the moving process rather than simply provide a removal van.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>How Chayce helped</b><span>Their coordinator managed the packing, removals, cleaning, utility transfers and the practical details around moving day.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>Outcome</b><span>Instead of coordinating several companies themselves, they had one person overseeing the move from preparation through to arrival.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>Service</b><span><a href="/silver-comfort/">Silver Comfort</a></span></div>
        <p class="cs-privacy">Client identity withheld at their request.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-card">
        <h3>A family arranging a long-established home move with full support</h3>
        <span class="cs-meta">Client story &middot; Platinum Bespoke</span>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>Situation</b><span>Robert&rsquo;s family wanted to make his move as easy as possible. He was leaving a long-established family home, had a large amount of belongings to sort through and needed considerable support before, during and after the move.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>What the family needed</b><span>They were not looking for individual services. They wanted one team to coordinate the entire transition.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>How Chayce helped</b><span>Chayce created a bespoke plan covering preparation of the home, sorting, packing, relocation, cleaning, setup and ongoing support after the move.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>Outcome</b><span>The family had a single team coordinating the transition, while Robert could focus on settling into his new home rather than managing the logistics.</span></div>
        <div class="cs-field"><b>Service</b><span><a href="/platinum-bespoke/">Platinum Bespoke</a></span></div>
        <p class="cs-privacy">Client identity withheld at their request.</p>
